    <string name="changes_in_v4_3">• New \"Empty Rectangle\" \"Hint\" strategy [Rainer Popella]\n• New translation to Finnish! [Joonas Reinholm]\n• New translation to Tamil! [தமிழ்நேரம் (anishprabu.t)]\n• New alert when player starts playing an unsolvable puzzle [Bart Uliasz]\n• Import/export screen rotation issues and cancellation on back button fix [Bart Uliasz]\n• Puzzle Editor fixes [Bart Uliasz]:\n\t• Fixed multiple puzzles crated on a new puzzle Save option usage\n\t• Fixed custom theme not being used in editor (Issue #107)\n\t• Fixed inconsistency in Save dialogs (Issue #127)\n• Fixed behaviour when user inputs current cell value (Issue #125) [Bart Uliasz]\n• Fixed physical keyboard value input did not enable highlighting of similar values [Bart Uliasz]\n• Fixed error on some devices that don\'t support ToneGenerator correctly [Bart Uliasz]\n• Solver fixes [Bart Uliasz]\n• Application responsiveness improved [Bart Uliasz]\n• Updated \"About\" and \"What\'s new\" dialogs [Bart Uliasz]\n• Settings UI improvements [Bart Uliasz]\n• Code refactors [Bart Uliasz, Rainer Popella]\n• Translations updates [Bart Uliasz, Joonas Reinholm, Óscar García Amor, Rainer Popella]</string>
